# @reference kq1/r03-c09
# Method: measured polygons plus freehand berries and foam; tracer-assisted line art for the bush outlines only.
# Hand-authored recreation of the KQ1 river bend (row 3, column 9).
# Back to front: sky → haze → far berry bushes → meadows → river and banks → boulder → oak.
scene "River bend"
variants day, night

sky 11
color lightblue
rect 0, 11, 159, 27
color blue
polygon 74,1 158,1 158,10 136,10 135,6 129,6 124,11 122,9 71,10 74,2
polygon 1,1 13,1 14,8 14,10 1,10 1,2

